#AREA Gardens of Chakkor~

#AUTHORS Prophecy~

#RANGES 10 20 0 99

#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG|AFLAG_NOCASTLE

#HELPS
1 gardens~
The Gardens of Chakkor are one of the newest and grandest sections that have
been added onto the City. It is said some of the most exotic plant life in the
entire planet can be found there on display.
~
0 $~

#MOBILES
#9650
gardener~
The Gardener~
A Gardener sits hear tending to his plants.~
Tall and slender the gardeners skin is well tanned from working outdoors for
the majority of his time. He often holds classes training and making others
practice the arts of gardening. He is often known to train and practice other
skills as well. As well as sell goods for the right price.
~
ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_SMART|ACT_PRACTICE|ACT_TRAIN|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_IS_NPC|ACT_RACE
AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_DETECT_INVIS
0 S
95 BODY_HEAD BODY_HAND 1d1+14999 1d1+94
1 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 99~
tell $n Greetings Visitor!
tell $n What brings you to the gardens today?
~
>speech_prog p lottie sent me~
if quest(2,8,$n) == 7
say Now why would she do that?
say You already helped her this Season!
else
say She must be wanting her stock of supplies now?
say Ok well lets see the List.
mpmset $n quest 2 8 1
endif
endif
~
>give_prog I9661~
mpjunk i9661
if quest(2,8,$n) == 1
say Hmmmmmm...
say These are not easy items to get this time of year.
say Why don't you go talk to one of the Apprentice Druids about the Kernels...
say why I try to track down where to find a watery gourd.
mpmset $n quest 2 8 1
endif
~
>give_prog I8904~
mpjunk i8904
if quest(2,8,$n) == 2
tell $n Excellent!
tell $n I have tracked down where you might find a Water Gourd.
tell $n Talk to one of the residents in the Plains of Fear.
tell $n Ask them about the Gourd.
mpmset $n quest 2 8 3
endif
~
>give_prog I13000~
mpjunk i13000
if quest(2,8,$n) == 3
say Wonderful, but we are still lacking the sunflower seeds!
say I do have but one magical seed left that can grow a sunflower plant.
say But it needs to be planted and watered in order for it to grow.
say And I do not have the time to tend to my vegetable garden.
mpoload 9657
give seed $n
say With the right tool, and a little patience maybe you can get it to grow?
mpmset $n quest 2 8 4
endif
~
>give_prog I9658~
mpjunk i9658
if quest(2,8,$n) == 5
say Good Job..!
say All you have to do is deliver this grocery bag to Lottie now!
mpoload 9663
give bag $n
mpmset $n quest 2 8 6
endif
~
>give_prog I9664~
mpjunk i9664
if quest(2,8,$n) == 6
say Thank You for your services!
say Here is your payment as a reward!
mpoload 9659
mpoload 9665
give gloves $n
give ring $n
mpmset $n quest 2 8 7
endif
~
|
