>fight_prog 19~
mpecho {110}A Druid Apprentices firebolt crackles through the air!
mpquiet on
c 'fireball'
mpquiet off
~
>speech_prog kernels~
if quest(2,8,$n) == 1
say Kernels you say..?
frown
say I don't have any off hand right now.
snap
smile
say But why don't you go talk to the Elder Druidess in the Holy Grove!
say I'm sure she would have some.
mpmset $n quest 2 8 2
~
>speech_prog thanks~
if quest(2,8,$n) == 2
say No problem, anytime.
endif
~
|
